          "instructions": "Part 2: Questions 11-15Complete the sentences below. WriteNO MORE THAN TWO WORDS OR A NUMBER.",
          "shared_content_html": "<p><strong>THE DINOSAUR MUSEUM</strong><br/>11. The museum closes at <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> p.m. on Mondays.<br/>12. The museum is not open on <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/><br/>13. School groups are met by tour guides in the <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/><br/>14. The whole visit takes 90 minutes, including <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> minutes for the guided tour.<br/>15. There are <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> behind the museum where students can have lunch.</p>",
