          "instructions": "Part 1: Questions 1-10Complete the notes below. WriteONE WORD AND/ OR A NUMBERfor each answer.",
          "shared_content_html": "<p><strong>Buckworth Conservation Group</strong><br/><strong>Regular activities</strong><br/><strong>Beach</strong><br/>\u2022 making sure the beach does not have <strong>(1)\u00a0<input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/></strong>\u00a0 on it<br/>\u2022 no <strong>(2) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/></strong></p><p><strong>Nature reserve</strong><br/>\u2022 maintaining paths<br/>\u2022 nesting boxes for birds installed<br/>\u2022 next task is taking action to attract <strong>(3) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/></strong>\u00a0 to the place<br/>\u2022 identifying types of <strong>(4) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/></strong><br/>\u2022 building a new <strong>(5) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/></strong></p><p><strong>Forthcoming events Saturday</strong><br/>\u2022 meet at Dunsmore Beach car park<br/>\u2022 walk across the sands and reach the <strong>(6) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/></strong><br/>\u2022 take a picnic<br/>\u2022 wear appropriate <strong>(7) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/></strong></p><p><strong>Woodwork session</strong><br/>\u2022 suitable for <strong>(8) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/></strong> to participate in<br/>\u2022 making <strong>(9) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/></strong> out of wood<br/>\u2022 17th, from 10 a.m. to 3 p.m.<br/>\u2022 cost of session (no camping): <strong>(10) \u00a3 <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/></strong></p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5477565220\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p>",
