          "shared_content_html": "<p></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Desert crocodiles sometimes live in places with dry periods that last up to <strong>(36)</strong> <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> months.</p><p></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A hole dug by a female crocodile in which to lay eggs can have a <strong>(37)</strong> <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> of up to 60 cm.</p><p></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Local people are not<strong> (38)</strong> <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> crocodiles.</p><p></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Crocodiles <strong>(39)</strong> <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> out of fear when humans populate their habitat.</p><p></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Researchers want to study more about population size, <strong>(40)</strong> <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> , and relations to other populations of crocodiles.<br/><br/><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p></p><p></p><input bg_collapse_expand=\"6abc4ccd17cab6069828716\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"6abc4ccd17cab6069828716\"/><input id=\"bg-show-more-text-6abc4ccd17cab6069828716\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Show Answers\"/><input id=\"bg-show-less-text-6abc4ccd17cab6069828716\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Hide Answers\"/><p></p>",
