      "title": "Reading Passage 3",
      "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>List of Headings</strong><br/>i An easily understood system<br/>ii Doubts dismissed<br/>iii Not a totally unconventional view<br/>iv Theories compared<br/>v A momentous occasion<br/>vi A controversial use of terminology<br/>vii Initial confusion<br/>viii Previous beliefs replaced<br/>ix More straightforward than expected<br/>x An obvious thing to do</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">27. Paragraph A<br/>28. Paragraph B<br/>29. Paragraph C<br/>30. Paragraph D<br/>31. Paragraph E<br/>32. Paragraph F</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img alt=\"\" data-lazyloaded=\"1\" data-src=\"../wp-content/uploads/2024/09/184-test-aca.png\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"447\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=\" width=\"599\"/><noscript><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"447\" src=\"../wp-content/uploads/2024/09/184-test-aca.png\" width=\"599\"/></noscript></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">37. an example of a modification made to work done by Howard<br/>38. a comparison between Howard\u2019s work and another classification system.<br/>39. a reference to the fact that Howard presented a very large amount of information<br/>40. an assumption that the audience asked themselves a question</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5477565220\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><input bg_collapse_expand=\"6abc97a22e8938044319691\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"6abc97a22e8938044319691\"/><input id=\"bg-show-more-text-6abc97a22e8938044319691\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Show Answers\"/><input id=\"bg-show-less-text-6abc97a22e8938044319691\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Hide Answers\"/>",
