      "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>A Year without a summer</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img alt=\"\" data-lazyloaded=\"1\" data-src=\"../wp-content/uploads/2024/09/test-173-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"507\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=\" width=\"538\"/><noscript><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"507\" src=\"../wp-content/uploads/2024/09/test-173-1.png\" width=\"538\"/></noscript></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Which location saw</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>A</strong> America<br/><strong>B</strong> Lake Toba<br/><strong>C</strong> London<br/><strong>D</strong> Northern Europe<br/><strong>E</strong> Philippines<br/><strong>F</strong> Switzerland<br/><strong>G</strong> Tambora</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">35. a positive effect of a volcanic eruption?<br/>36. the biggest volcanic eruption?<br/>37. scientific observation?<br/>38. a series of eruptions?<br/>39. buildings destroyed?<br/>40. a book written?</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><input bg_collapse_expand=\"6abc95c0bf2ed3054774818\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"6abc95c0bf2ed3054774818\"/><input id=\"bg-show-more-text-6abc95c0bf2ed3054774818\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Show Answers\"/><input id=\"bg-show-less-text-6abc95c0bf2ed3054774818\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Hide Answers\"/>",
