      "passage_number": 3,
      "title": "Reading Passage 3",
      "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Match each statement to the correct person.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>A</strong> Dr. Mayalla<br/><strong>B</strong> Anita Brown<br/><strong>C</strong> Bob Ratchett</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">32. This person acknowledges certain inadequacies in the concept of care in the community, but recognises that attempts have been made to improve on existing schemes.<br/>33. This person whilst emphasising the benefits to the patient from care in the community schemes is critical of traditional care methods.<br/>34. This person\u2019s views have been moderated by their professional contact with the mentally ill.<br/>35. This person places the welfare of others above that of the mentally ill.<br/>36. This person acknowledges that a mistrust of care in the community schemes may be unfounded.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>TRUE</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0if the statement agrees with the information<br/><strong>FALSE</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0if the statement contradicts the information<br/><strong>NOT GIVEN</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 if there is no information on this</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">37. There is a better understanding of the dynamics of mental illness today.<br/>38. Community care schemes do not provide adequate psychological support for patients.<br/>39. Dr. Mayalla believes that the scheme is less successful than in the past.<br/>40. The goal of community care schemes is to make patients less dependent on the system.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><input bg_collapse_expand=\"6abca3afa6f2d0065697901\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"6abca3afa6f2d0065697901\"/><input id=\"bg-show-more-text-6abca3afa6f2d0065697901\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Show Answers\"/><input id=\"bg-show-less-text-6abca3afa6f2d0065697901\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Hide Answers\"/>",
