      "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">While some might live in tall buildings, others might live in (29)\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Important thing is to talk with your kids about escape (30)\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026and escape routes .</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Making a (31)\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026..is a good idea, it can help you escape.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">If you live in an apartment, you have to know the way to the staircase or other (32)\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026.. .</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">You can only open the door if the (33)\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026.is not hot and you can\u2019t see smoke around the door.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">You should immediately close the door, if smoke (34)\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026into the room</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>TRUE</strong> if the statement agrees with the information<br/><strong>FALSE</strong> if the statement contradicts the information<br/><strong>NOT GIVEN</strong> If there is no information on this</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">35. It is important to have a strategy before escaping the fire.<br/>36. You should mark different ways out of your home on the map.<br/>37. If you\u2019re stuck in a room, and see smoke coming into your room, you should open the door and ran to the exit.<br/>38. Hot door means you shouldn\u2019t open it to escape.<br/>39. If you open the door and everything seems fine, go straight to the exit.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">40. This article is mainly aimed at helping:<br/><strong>A</strong> Children<br/><strong>B</strong> Children and their parents<br/><strong>C</strong> Only parents<br/><strong>D</strong> Teachers at schools</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><input bg_collapse_expand=\"6abd5aa8866ee5013114270\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"6abd5aa8866ee5013114270\"/><input id=\"bg-show-more-text-6abd5aa8866ee5013114270\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Show Answers\"/><input id=\"bg-show-less-text-6abd5aa8866ee5013114270\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Hide Answers\"/>",
