          "instructions": "Questions 33-37Look at the following statements (Questions 33-37) and the list of explorers below. Match each statement with the correct explorer, A-E. Write the correct letter, A-E, in boxes 33-37. NB You may use any letter more than once.",
          "shared_content_html": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Questions 33-37</strong><br/>Look at the following statements (Questions 33-37) and the list of explorers below. Match each statement with the correct explorer, A-E. Write the correct letter, A-E, in boxes 33-37. NB You may use any letter more than once.</p>",
