      "passage_number": 3,
      "title": "Reading Passage 3",
      "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">A. Timber and petro-chemical industries threatened</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">B. Articles praise hemp as a potential billion dollar crop</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">C. Widespread cultivation of hemp (Example)</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">D. Prohibition of marijuana</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">E. Newspaper articles link hemp to violent crime</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">F. Development of stripping machines</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The first one has been done for you as an example.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Example: C</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">(27) \u2026\u2026..</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">(28) \u2026\u2026.</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">(29) \u2026\u2026.</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">(30) \u2026\u2026.</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">(31) \u2026\u2026\u2026</span></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 14.0541%; border-style: solid; border-color: #000000;\" width=\"104\"></td><td style=\"width: 30.6757%; border-style: solid; border-color: #000000;\" width=\"227\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Hemp</strong></span></td><td style=\"width: 35.5405%; border-style: solid; border-color: #000000;\" width=\"263\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Marijuana </strong></span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 14.0541%; border-style: solid; border-color: #000000;\" width=\"104\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Fibre</strong></span></td><td style=\"width: 30.6757%; border-style: solid; border-color: #000000;\" width=\"227\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Strong and durable</span></td><td style=\"width: 35.5405%; border-style: solid; border-color: #000000;\" width=\"263\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">(32)\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026..</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 14.0541%; border-style: solid; border-color: #000000;\" width=\"104\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Drug content</strong></span></td><td style=\"width: 30.6757%; border-style: solid; border-color: #000000;\" width=\"227\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">No active substances named (33) \u2026\u2026</span></td><td style=\"width: 35.5405%; border-style: solid; border-color: #000000;\" width=\"263\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Up to 10%</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">A. Hemp</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">B. Wood</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">C. Cotton</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">34. mildew-resistant</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">35. dioxin is a by-product of processing</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">36. can be harvested more than once a year</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">37. large amounts of fertiliser needed</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">38. fire-retardant properties</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">39. requires mild temperature</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">40. The main purpose of this article is</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>A</strong> to criticise government policy on hemp.</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>B</strong> to show the economic benefits of hemp.</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>C</strong> to compare hemp and marijuana.</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>D</strong> to promote research into new uses of hemp.</span></p><p><br/>\n<br/>\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display:block\"></ins><br/> </p><input bg_collapse_expand=\"6abd1aebcf1918089248255\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"6abd1aebcf1918089248255\"/><input id=\"bg-show-more-text-6abd1aebcf1918089248255\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Show Answers\"/><input id=\"bg-show-less-text-6abd1aebcf1918089248255\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"Hide Answers\"/>",
