      "task_number": 2,
      "prompt_html": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><u>Task 2:</u></strong> Some parents specially mothers stay at home instead working and some people think they should receive monetary compensation from the government. Do you agree or disagree?</p><p></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Write at least 250 words.</p><p></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"../cambridge-ielts-1-13-tests/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cambridge IELTS Tests 1 to 17</strong></a></p><p></p>",
      "word_requirement": 250,
