      "prompt_html": "<p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"../cambridge-ielts-1-13-tests/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cambridge IELTS Tests 1 to 17</strong></a></p><p><strong><u>Task 1: </u></strong>The table below shows the average band scores for students from different language groups taking the IELTS General Test in 2010.</p><p></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. Write at least 150 words.</p><p></p><p></p><figure><table><thead><tr><th>\u00a0</th><th>Listening</th><th>Reading</th><th>Writing</th><th>Speaking</th><th>Overall</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>German</td><td>6.8</td><td>6.3</td><td>6.6</td><td>6.9</td><td>6.7</td></tr><tr><td>French</td><td>6.3</td><td>6.1</td><td>6.5</td><td>6.6</td><td>6.5</td></tr><tr><td>Indonesian</td><td>6.3</td><td>6.1</td><td>6.1</td><td>6.7</td><td>6.3</td></tr><tr><td>Malay</td><td>6.2</td><td>6.4</td><td>6.0</td><td>6.6</td><td>6.4</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br/><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins><br/></p><p></p><p></p>",
