      "task_number": 1,
      "prompt_html": "<p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"../cambridge-ielts-1-13-tests/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cambridge IELTS Tests 1 to 17</strong></a></p><p><strong><u>Task 1:</u></strong> The table below shows the cinema viewing figures for films by country, in millions.</p><p></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. Write at least 150 words.</p><p></p><p></p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-transform: capitalize;\">cinema viewing figures for films by country in millions</h2><p></p><p></p><figure><table><thead><tr><th>\u00a0</th><th>Action</th><th>Romance</th><th>Comedy</th><th>Horror</th><th>Total</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>India</td><td>8</td><td>7.5</td><td>6.5</td><td>2.5</td><td><strong>24.5</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Ireland</td><td>7.6</td><td>3.8</td><td>5.5</td><td>6.4</td><td><strong>23.3</strong></td></tr><tr><td>New Zealand</td><td>7.2</td><td>4.5</td><td>3.9</td><td>4.7</td><td><strong>20.3</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Japan</td><td>7.1</td><td>4.5</td><td>4.0</td><td>2.2</td><td><strong>17.8</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Total</strong></td><td><strong>29.9</strong></td><td><strong>20.3</strong></td><td><strong>19.9</strong></td><td><strong>15.8</strong></td><td>\u00a0</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p></p><p></p><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br/><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins><br/></p><p></p><p></p>",
