  "test_id": "advice",
  "title": "Talk about a thing you complained about something (but finally got a good result) \u2013 IELTS MASTER",
  "part": "Part 2",
  "topic": "Talk about a time when you gave advice to someone",
  "content_type": "sample_answer",
  "cue_card_instructions": null,
  "prompts": [],
  "supporting_text": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p><p>1. I reside in a very serene society.<br/>2. In my society all the inhabitants are cordial.<br/>3. Everybody knows everybody and often we celebrate occasions together.<br/>4. Seldom there is any dispute and if there is one then it is resolved amicably.<br/>5. Recently a family came to live in our building and they took the apartment just above ours.<br/>6. Their younger son, Arun is nearly of my age.<br/>7. And he is a huge fan of rock music which I could tell from the sound that came from above every evening.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. Initially the sound levels were unobtrusive but after a few days the volume grew louder and since he played it till late in the night, it interfered with my sleep.<br/>9. I thought it might be one off case but when it continued for some days I decided to talk to his parents.<br/>10. His parents seemed like nice people and assured me that they would talk to their son.<br/>11. For few days things went back to normal but then he again started playing music loudly.<br/>12. I again complained to his parents and this time they suggested that I talk to him in person because I might be in a better position to explain my trouble.<br/>13. Initially I had some apprehensions because for some reason I had construed this image of Arun being a stubborn boy.<br/>14. I guess that was because of the perception of western rock stars in my mind.<br/>15. But when I talked to him, he came across as a very jovial person.<br/>16. As I had guessed rightly, he is diehard fan of rock music and told me that for him rock music is a stress buster.<br/>17. Lately he had been under stress because of his school tests performance therefore he resorted to his usual relaxing activity.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>18. When I told him that his loud music had been really disturbing for me he sincerely apologized and assured that it will not happen again.<br/>19. Since then he has not given me a chance to complain and we have become very good friends.<br/>20. We share some common interests and spend quality time whenever we get time.<br/>21. I am glad that I met him which might not have happened if he had not played loud music in first place.</p><p><a href=\"../cambridge-ielts-1-13-tests/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cambridge IELTS TESTS 1 TO 13</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p></div><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p><p>1. I reside in a very serene society.<br/>2. In my society all the inhabitants are cordial.<br/>3. Everybody knows everybody and often we celebrate occasions together.<br/>4. Seldom there is any dispute and if there is one then it is resolved amicably.<br/>5. Recently a family came to live in our building and they took the apartment just above ours.<br/>6. Their younger son, Arun is nearly of my age.<br/>7. And he is a huge fan of rock music which I could tell from the sound that came from above every evening.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. Initially the sound levels were unobtrusive but after a few days the volume grew louder and since he played it till late in the night, it interfered with my sleep.<br/>9. I thought it might be one off case but when it continued for some days I decided to talk to his parents.<br/>10. His parents seemed like nice people and assured me that they would talk to their son.<br/>11. For few days things went back to normal but then he again started playing music loudly.<br/>12. I again complained to his parents and this time they suggested that I talk to him in person because I might be in a better position to explain my trouble.<br/>13. Initially I had some apprehensions because for some reason I had construed this image of Arun being a stubborn boy.<br/>14. I guess that was because of the perception of western rock stars in my mind.<br/>15. But when I talked to him, he came across as a very jovial person.<br/>16. As I had guessed rightly, he is diehard fan of rock music and told me that for him rock music is a stress buster.<br/>17. Lately he had been under stress because of his school tests performance therefore he resorted to his usual relaxing activity.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>18. When I told him that his loud music had been really disturbing for me he sincerely apologized and assured that it will not happen again.<br/>19. Since then he has not given me a chance to complain and we have become very good friends.<br/>20. We share some common interests and spend quality time whenever we get time.<br/>21. I am glad that I met him which might not have happened if he had not played loud music in first place.</p><p><a href=\"../cambridge-ielts-1-13-tests/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cambridge IELTS TESTS 1 TO 13</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p>",
