  "supporting_text": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p><p>1. Friends are like extended family.<br/>2. Friends are paramount in our lives because with friends we can be anybody we want to be.<br/>3. They are true stress busters.<br/>4. With family members we might sometimes feel reluctant but with friends we are akin to an open book.<br/>5. I have been blessed with some wonderful friends and some of the most cherished memories of my childhood are from the time I spent with my friends.<br/>6. Although it is almost impossible to pick my favorite friend since they all were very dear to me, there is one of them for whom I am really grateful to almighty.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>7. I am talking about my childhood friend Arun.<br/>8. He is my oldest friend and I know him since I was 3 years old.<br/>9. He was my neighbor and we grew up together.<br/>10. We went to the same school and joined same club for evening activities.<br/>11. We spent a lot of time at each other\u2019s home and many a times I slept over at his house.<br/>12. He is very supportive and understanding and whenever I feel despondent I look for him because he knows exactly how to lift my spirits.<br/>13. He is a complete all-rounder and excels in everything he partakes in.<br/>14. He was the monitor of our class as well as the captain of our school football team.<br/>15. He had won several accolades and had made our school proud.<br/>16. He is an avid football fan and is crazy for Manchester United football club.<br/>17. He actually dreams of playing for this club one day.<br/>18. Lately football has gained a significant popularity in our nation and club football has become a viable career option.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>19. Keeping his dream in mind, his father made him join a professional football academy.<br/>20. The head coach was instantly impressed by his football skills and the acumen he possesses for the game.<br/>21. He is confident that given the right guidance Arun can become a professional footballer.<br/>22. I would be the happiest person on this earth if he manages to achieve his goal and would proudly say that I am friend of Arun.</p><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p></div><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p><p>1. Friends are like extended family.<br/>2. Friends are paramount in our lives because with friends we can be anybody we want to be.<br/>3. They are true stress busters.<br/>4. With family members we might sometimes feel reluctant but with friends we are akin to an open book.<br/>5. I have been blessed with some wonderful friends and some of the most cherished memories of my childhood are from the time I spent with my friends.<br/>6. Although it is almost impossible to pick my favorite friend since they all were very dear to me, there is one of them for whom I am really grateful to almighty.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>7. I am talking about my childhood friend Arun.<br/>8. He is my oldest friend and I know him since I was 3 years old.<br/>9. He was my neighbor and we grew up together.<br/>10. We went to the same school and joined same club for evening activities.<br/>11. We spent a lot of time at each other\u2019s home and many a times I slept over at his house.<br/>12. He is very supportive and understanding and whenever I feel despondent I look for him because he knows exactly how to lift my spirits.<br/>13. He is a complete all-rounder and excels in everything he partakes in.<br/>14. He was the monitor of our class as well as the captain of our school football team.<br/>15. He had won several accolades and had made our school proud.<br/>16. He is an avid football fan and is crazy for Manchester United football club.<br/>17. He actually dreams of playing for this club one day.<br/>18. Lately football has gained a significant popularity in our nation and club football has become a viable career option.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>19. Keeping his dream in mind, his father made him join a professional football academy.<br/>20. The head coach was instantly impressed by his football skills and the acumen he possesses for the game.<br/>21. He is confident that given the right guidance Arun can become a professional footballer.<br/>22. I would be the happiest person on this earth if he manages to achieve his goal and would proudly say that I am friend of Arun.</p><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p>",
