  "supporting_text": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p>1. Last year I went to Andaman Islands in my summer vacation.<br/>2. The islands are nearly 2000 miles away from my city.<br/>3. Given the huge amount of distance, the most preferred way to travel to these islands from my city is either train or aircraft.<br/>4. The journey by train takes nearly two days to finish which terminates at a port city from where the last mile to the island is covered by a ship.<br/>5. I knew it was not going to be easy to spend two whole days in a train so I decided to carry some sources of entertainment with me.<br/>6. My two favorite pastimes are reading and listening to music.<br/>7. For reading I put the book in my luggage which I was already reading but I was troubled to arrange for a source of music.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. I generally hear music on my laptop but I did not want to carry my laptop because of its bulky nature and also I was a bit apprehensive about the damage that might happen to it during the journey.<br/>9. Hence I needed something that would be easy to carry and not fragile which would be prone to damage.<br/>10. I knew exactly what would solve my purpose and that was an mp3 player which I bought two days before our departure.<br/>11. Though it was a magnificent piece of technology, manufactured by Sony the pioneer in the field of music players, I to some extent regret my decision to buy it because after that trip I have used it only on couple of more occasions only.<br/>12. Still in terms of quality and utility I would recommend this if somebody is looking for a good mp3 player.<br/>13. The internal capacity of the player is 8 GB which is enough to store more than 2000 songs.<br/>14. Transferring the songs was a cinch, I just had to plug in the player in the USB port of my laptop and copy paste the songs of my liking.<br/>15. The battery life of the player was really impressive I just charged it for 5 hours after which I gave me a playback time of nearly 30 hours.<br/>16. I was really amazed by the features that were embedded in such a small piece of technology.<br/>17. I could sort songs by the names of singers, albums and duration of the song.<br/>18. It also had the feature of marking songs as favorite which enabled me to easily find and play the songs which I liked the most.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>19. All of these features were made easy to access with the help of a 5 inch touchscreen which was highly responsive and accurate.<br/>20. It is a marvelous piece of technology but unfortunately I don\u2019t get much time to use it in my daily hectic schedule.</p><p>\u00a0</p><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar Speaking CUE CARDS with NEW SOLUTIONS</strong></a></p></div><p>1. Last year I went to Andaman Islands in my summer vacation.<br/>2. The islands are nearly 2000 miles away from my city.<br/>3. Given the huge amount of distance, the most preferred way to travel to these islands from my city is either train or aircraft.<br/>4. The journey by train takes nearly two days to finish which terminates at a port city from where the last mile to the island is covered by a ship.<br/>5. I knew it was not going to be easy to spend two whole days in a train so I decided to carry some sources of entertainment with me.<br/>6. My two favorite pastimes are reading and listening to music.<br/>7. For reading I put the book in my luggage which I was already reading but I was troubled to arrange for a source of music.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. I generally hear music on my laptop but I did not want to carry my laptop because of its bulky nature and also I was a bit apprehensive about the damage that might happen to it during the journey.<br/>9. Hence I needed something that would be easy to carry and not fragile which would be prone to damage.<br/>10. I knew exactly what would solve my purpose and that was an mp3 player which I bought two days before our departure.<br/>11. Though it was a magnificent piece of technology, manufactured by Sony the pioneer in the field of music players, I to some extent regret my decision to buy it because after that trip I have used it only on couple of more occasions only.<br/>12. Still in terms of quality and utility I would recommend this if somebody is looking for a good mp3 player.<br/>13. The internal capacity of the player is 8 GB which is enough to store more than 2000 songs.<br/>14. Transferring the songs was a cinch, I just had to plug in the player in the USB port of my laptop and copy paste the songs of my liking.<br/>15. The battery life of the player was really impressive I just charged it for 5 hours after which I gave me a playback time of nearly 30 hours.<br/>16. I was really amazed by the features that were embedded in such a small piece of technology.<br/>17. I could sort songs by the names of singers, albums and duration of the song.<br/>18. It also had the feature of marking songs as favorite which enabled me to easily find and play the songs which I liked the most.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>19. All of these features were made easy to access with the help of a 5 inch touchscreen which was highly responsive and accurate.<br/>20. It is a marvelous piece of technology but unfortunately I don\u2019t get much time to use it in my daily hectic schedule.</p><p>\u00a0</p><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar Speaking CUE CARDS with NEW SOLUTIONS</strong></a></p>",
