  "test_id": "advice",
  "title": "Describe one of your family members you spend the most time with \u2013 IELTS MASTER",
  "part": "Part 2",
  "topic": "Talk about a time when you gave advice to someone",
  "content_type": "sample_answer",
  "cue_card_instructions": null,
  "prompts": [],
  "supporting_text": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p>1. I have been blessed with a wonderful family.<br/>2. Everything I have ever wished for I have been granted by my parents.<br/>3. There is another member in my family to whom I would say I am feel the most comfortable with and that person is my younger brother Arun.<br/>4. He is 4 years younger to me.<br/>5. We are very close to each other and share everything with each other.<br/>6. He is just like a friend to me.<br/>7. I vividly remember the day he was born.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5477565220\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. The whole family was over the moon and there was a huge celebration at our place.<br/>9. Honestly I was a bit envious at that moment because he was getting all the attention and that remained the case for some years to come.<br/>10. But I guess that is how all the children feel when focus is shifted from them.<br/>11. Well that was a temporary phase which eventually passed.<br/>12. I am actually blessed to have brother like Arun.<br/>13. He is very supportive and understanding.<br/>14. Although I am the elder brother but there are times when he exhibits more maturity than me.<br/>15. He is an ideal brother and son.<br/>16. He has never given a chance to our parents to complain.<br/>17. He is a complete all-rounder and excels in everything he partakes in.<br/>18. He is the monitor of his class as well as the captain of his school football team.<br/>19. He has won several accolades and has made our family proud.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>20. He is an avid football fan and is crazy for Manchester United football club.<br/>21. He actually dreams of playing for this club one day.<br/>22. Lately football has gained a significant popularity in our nation and club football has become a viable career option.<br/>23. Keeping his dream in mind, my father made him join a professional football academy.<br/>24. The head coach was instantly impressed by his football skills and the acumen he possesses for the game.<br/>25. He is confident that given the right guidance Arun can become a professional footballer.<br/>26. I would be happiest person on this earth if he manages to achieve his goal and would proudly say that I am brother of Arun.</p></div><p>1. I have been blessed with a wonderful family.<br/>2. Everything I have ever wished for I have been granted by my parents.<br/>3. There is another member in my family to whom I would say I am feel the most comfortable with and that person is my younger brother Arun.<br/>4. He is 4 years younger to me.<br/>5. We are very close to each other and share everything with each other.<br/>6. He is just like a friend to me.<br/>7. I vividly remember the day he was born.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5477565220\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. The whole family was over the moon and there was a huge celebration at our place.<br/>9. Honestly I was a bit envious at that moment because he was getting all the attention and that remained the case for some years to come.<br/>10. But I guess that is how all the children feel when focus is shifted from them.<br/>11. Well that was a temporary phase which eventually passed.<br/>12. I am actually blessed to have brother like Arun.<br/>13. He is very supportive and understanding.<br/>14. Although I am the elder brother but there are times when he exhibits more maturity than me.<br/>15. He is an ideal brother and son.<br/>16. He has never given a chance to our parents to complain.<br/>17. He is a complete all-rounder and excels in everything he partakes in.<br/>18. He is the monitor of his class as well as the captain of his school football team.<br/>19. He has won several accolades and has made our family proud.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>20. He is an avid football fan and is crazy for Manchester United football club.<br/>21. He actually dreams of playing for this club one day.<br/>22. Lately football has gained a significant popularity in our nation and club football has become a viable career option.<br/>23. Keeping his dream in mind, my father made him join a professional football academy.<br/>24. The head coach was instantly impressed by his football skills and the acumen he possesses for the game.<br/>25. He is confident that given the right guidance Arun can become a professional footballer.<br/>26. I would be happiest person on this earth if he manages to achieve his goal and would proudly say that I am brother of Arun.</p>",
