  "test_id": "advice",
  "title": "Describe something that you brought from a tourist place \u2013 IELTS MASTER",
  "part": "Part 2",
  "topic": "Talk about a time when you gave advice to someone",
  "content_type": "sample_answer",
  "cue_card_instructions": null,
  "prompts": [],
  "supporting_text": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p>1. Last year I went to Andaman Islands in my summer vacation.<br/>2. The islands are nearly 2000 miles away from my city.<br/>3. Given the huge amount of distance, the most preferred way to travel to these islands from my city is either train or aircraft.<br/>4. Since the aircraft tickets are really expensive in holiday season due to heightened demand, my parents decided to commute by train.<br/>5. The journey by train takes nearly two days to finish which terminates at a port city from where the last mile to the island is covered by a ship.<br/>6. I knew it was not going to be easy to spend two whole days in a train so I decided to carry some sources of entertainment with me.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5477565220\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>7. My two favorite pastimes are reading and listening to music.<br/>8. For reading I put the book in my luggage which I was already reading and was confident that it would be sufficient for the entire trip.<br/>9. But I proved to be wrong.<br/>10. On the very first day of our trip I got bored of reading the book because I had been reading it for 2 two hours at a stretch since I had no other source of entertainment.<br/>11. It was then I decided that I need something else as well to break the monotony.<br/>12. I thought of few options and since music is my other love I decided to buy an MP3 player.<br/>13. I told this to my father and he happily agree to buy me an MP3 player.<br/>14. So went to an electronics shop for our purchase.<br/>15. The shop owner showed us variety of MP3 players of different brands but there was one gadget which caught my attention at the first glance.<br/>16. It was a magnificent piece of technology, manufactured by Sony the pioneer in the field of music players.<br/>17. I then asked the shop owner about the features of that particular MP3 player and had already made up my mind to buy it irrespectively.<br/>18. He told me that the internal capacity of the player was 8 GB which was enough to store more than 2000 songs.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>19. Transferring the songs was a cinch, I just had to plug in the player in the USB port of my laptop and copy paste the songs of my liking.<br/>20. The battery life of the player was really impressive I just had to charge it for 3 hours after which I would give me a playback time of nearly 30 hours.<br/>21. I was really amazed by the features that were embedded in such a small piece of technology.<br/>22. I could sort songs by the names of singers, albums and duration of the song.<br/>23. It also had the feature of marking songs as favorite which enabled me to easily find and play the songs which I liked the most.<br/>24. All of these features were made easy to access with the help of a 5 inch touchscreen which was highly responsive and accurate.<br/>25. It is easily the best buy I have ever made on any of my vacation trips.<br/>26. Really the advancement in the technology never ceases to amaze me and this mp3 player was one such example of this phenomenon.</p></div><p>1. Last year I went to Andaman Islands in my summer vacation.<br/>2. The islands are nearly 2000 miles away from my city.<br/>3. Given the huge amount of distance, the most preferred way to travel to these islands from my city is either train or aircraft.<br/>4. Since the aircraft tickets are really expensive in holiday season due to heightened demand, my parents decided to commute by train.<br/>5. The journey by train takes nearly two days to finish which terminates at a port city from where the last mile to the island is covered by a ship.<br/>6. I knew it was not going to be easy to spend two whole days in a train so I decided to carry some sources of entertainment with me.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5477565220\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>7. My two favorite pastimes are reading and listening to music.<br/>8. For reading I put the book in my luggage which I was already reading and was confident that it would be sufficient for the entire trip.<br/>9. But I proved to be wrong.<br/>10. On the very first day of our trip I got bored of reading the book because I had been reading it for 2 two hours at a stretch since I had no other source of entertainment.<br/>11. It was then I decided that I need something else as well to break the monotony.<br/>12. I thought of few options and since music is my other love I decided to buy an MP3 player.<br/>13. I told this to my father and he happily agree to buy me an MP3 player.<br/>14. So went to an electronics shop for our purchase.<br/>15. The shop owner showed us variety of MP3 players of different brands but there was one gadget which caught my attention at the first glance.<br/>16. It was a magnificent piece of technology, manufactured by Sony the pioneer in the field of music players.<br/>17. I then asked the shop owner about the features of that particular MP3 player and had already made up my mind to buy it irrespectively.<br/>18. He told me that the internal capacity of the player was 8 GB which was enough to store more than 2000 songs.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>19. Transferring the songs was a cinch, I just had to plug in the player in the USB port of my laptop and copy paste the songs of my liking.<br/>20. The battery life of the player was really impressive I just had to charge it for 3 hours after which I would give me a playback time of nearly 30 hours.<br/>21. I was really amazed by the features that were embedded in such a small piece of technology.<br/>22. I could sort songs by the names of singers, albums and duration of the song.<br/>23. It also had the feature of marking songs as favorite which enabled me to easily find and play the songs which I liked the most.<br/>24. All of these features were made easy to access with the help of a 5 inch touchscreen which was highly responsive and accurate.<br/>25. It is easily the best buy I have ever made on any of my vacation trips.<br/>26. Really the advancement in the technology never ceases to amaze me and this mp3 player was one such example of this phenomenon.</p>",
