  "topic": "Talk about a time when you gave advice to someone",
  "content_type": "sample_answer",
  "cue_card_instructions": null,
  "prompts": [],
  "supporting_text": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p>1. Today\u2019s modern life has become very hectic.</p><p>2. But there are sporadic moments when we all get some time for ourselves and I think we should take out some time for ourselves.<br/>3. These are the times when one can do some introspection or do something he or she really loves to do.<br/>4. Everybody has his or her way to spend these pleasurable moments.<br/>5. I like to resort to reading whenever I get free time because reading not only relaxes me it also empowers me to grow intellectually.<br/>6. Reading on different topics allows me to build an all-round perspective.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5477565220\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>7. Although I like to read on all important topics for a holistic improvement, I particularly enjoy reading philosophy.<br/>8. I know the general perception about philosophy is that it is a heavy and insipid subject but I find it really interesting and some of the research articles I have read are really exciting.<br/>9. Recently I read an article titled \u2018The Daily Stoic\u2019.<br/>10. It was a collection of teachings of several prominent ancient Greek philosopher such as Plato, Aristotle and Socrates.<br/>11. I found this article exciting because it provided a completely different view on life.<br/>12. It taught me a way to simplify life which we have otherwise made so complicated with our desires.<br/>13. There is no human being on this planet whose entire life is a bed of roses.<br/>14. Everybody has to go through hardships at some stage of his or her life and these are the times when one\u2019s character is tested.<br/>15. What I have learnt from this article is that during tough times the most important thing is to maintain one\u2019s integrity.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>16. The teachings in this article are not meant for a weak-willed person.<br/>17. While these teachings were pleasing to read but to inculcate these in your daily life is highly challenging and this challenge is what I find the most exciting.<br/>18. I know if I am able to implement only few of the instructions given in the article, I would come out as a better and an enlightened human being.</p></div><p>1. Today\u2019s modern life has become very hectic.</p><p>2. But there are sporadic moments when we all get some time for ourselves and I think we should take out some time for ourselves.<br/>3. These are the times when one can do some introspection or do something he or she really loves to do.<br/>4. Everybody has his or her way to spend these pleasurable moments.<br/>5. I like to resort to reading whenever I get free time because reading not only relaxes me it also empowers me to grow intellectually.<br/>6. Reading on different topics allows me to build an all-round perspective.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5477565220\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>7. Although I like to read on all important topics for a holistic improvement, I particularly enjoy reading philosophy.<br/>8. I know the general perception about philosophy is that it is a heavy and insipid subject but I find it really interesting and some of the research articles I have read are really exciting.<br/>9. Recently I read an article titled \u2018The Daily Stoic\u2019.<br/>10. It was a collection of teachings of several prominent ancient Greek philosopher such as Plato, Aristotle and Socrates.<br/>11. I found this article exciting because it provided a completely different view on life.<br/>12. It taught me a way to simplify life which we have otherwise made so complicated with our desires.<br/>13. There is no human being on this planet whose entire life is a bed of roses.<br/>14. Everybody has to go through hardships at some stage of his or her life and these are the times when one\u2019s character is tested.<br/>15. What I have learnt from this article is that during tough times the most important thing is to maintain one\u2019s integrity.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>16. The teachings in this article are not meant for a weak-willed person.<br/>17. While these teachings were pleasing to read but to inculcate these in your daily life is highly challenging and this challenge is what I find the most exciting.<br/>18. I know if I am able to implement only few of the instructions given in the article, I would come out as a better and an enlightened human being.</p>",
