  "supporting_text": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p><p>1. My city is known for two things \u2013 food and clothes.<br/>2. The variety in both the categories is just staggering.<br/>3. And the reasonable prices just add to the attraction for the buyers who comprise not only of local residents but also consumers from other states.<br/>4. There are several shopping venues which are popular in my city but there is one particular place that epitomizes the things my city is famous for.<br/>5. The place is Grand Avenue market which is the busiest street market in the city.<br/>6. There are several reasons behind huge popularity of this market.<br/>7. One of the biggest advantages of the market is its central location which makes it easily accessible to all the people of the city.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. But for me the main attraction is the options that it provides me.<br/>9. I am not a brand conscious person but I don\u2019t mind wearing branded clothes either.<br/>10. I am not willing to pay exorbitant price just to put a brand name on my clothes.<br/>11. For me there should be a balance between the appearance of a clothing and the price I pay for it.<br/>12. And that is why I love this place because it gives me that perfect balance.<br/>13. All the major clothing brands have their outlets in this market.<br/>14. Every time I visit these outlets I can easily find some offers running which allow me to make good purchases within my purchasing power.<br/>15. I might not get the best of the lot but I always get decent clothes at reasonable prices.<br/>16. I have already gathered a nice collection of clothes, shoes and some accessories.<br/>17. There is one more reason why I like this place and that is food shops present there.<br/>18. Every time I go there for shopping, I specially reserve extra half an hour for a visit to the food shops.<br/>19. I simply love the place for the options it provides which I don\u2019t normally find at other food joints.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>20. I can choose from all the popular cuisines including Indian, Continental, Chinese, Mexican, Mughlai, Italian and many more.<br/>21. I find this place really exciting and whenever I am a bit stressed I visit there with my friends.</p><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p></div><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p><p>1. My city is known for two things \u2013 food and clothes.<br/>2. The variety in both the categories is just staggering.<br/>3. And the reasonable prices just add to the attraction for the buyers who comprise not only of local residents but also consumers from other states.<br/>4. There are several shopping venues which are popular in my city but there is one particular place that epitomizes the things my city is famous for.<br/>5. The place is Grand Avenue market which is the busiest street market in the city.<br/>6. There are several reasons behind huge popularity of this market.<br/>7. One of the biggest advantages of the market is its central location which makes it easily accessible to all the people of the city.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. But for me the main attraction is the options that it provides me.<br/>9. I am not a brand conscious person but I don\u2019t mind wearing branded clothes either.<br/>10. I am not willing to pay exorbitant price just to put a brand name on my clothes.<br/>11. For me there should be a balance between the appearance of a clothing and the price I pay for it.<br/>12. And that is why I love this place because it gives me that perfect balance.<br/>13. All the major clothing brands have their outlets in this market.<br/>14. Every time I visit these outlets I can easily find some offers running which allow me to make good purchases within my purchasing power.<br/>15. I might not get the best of the lot but I always get decent clothes at reasonable prices.<br/>16. I have already gathered a nice collection of clothes, shoes and some accessories.<br/>17. There is one more reason why I like this place and that is food shops present there.<br/>18. Every time I go there for shopping, I specially reserve extra half an hour for a visit to the food shops.<br/>19. I simply love the place for the options it provides which I don\u2019t normally find at other food joints.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>20. I can choose from all the popular cuisines including Indian, Continental, Chinese, Mexican, Mughlai, Italian and many more.<br/>21. I find this place really exciting and whenever I am a bit stressed I visit there with my friends.</p><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p>",
