  "supporting_text": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p>1. My city is known for two things \u2013 food and clothes.<br/>2. The variety in both the categories is just staggering.<br/>3. And the reasonable prices just add to the attraction for the buyers who comprise not only of local residents but also consumers from other states.<br/>4. I too often bought clothes from a shop near by my home.<br/>5. Earlier I did not have a liking for a particular shop but of late I have developed a predilection for a shopping place.<br/>6. The place is Alpha shopping mall.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>7. It opened only two months back and has already become a popular place among local residents to hang out.<br/>8. Irrespective of the day of the week the place is swarmed with people because it is a one stop shop for people.<br/>9. The biggest advantage of the shopping mall is its central location which makes it easily accessible to all the people of the city.<br/>10. But for me the main attraction is the options that it provides me.<br/>11. I am not a brand conscious person but I don\u2019t mind wearing branded clothes either.<br/>12. I am not willing to pay exorbitant price just to put a brand name on my clothes.<br/>13. For me there should be a balance between the appearance of a clothing and the price I pay for it.<br/>14. And that is why I love this place because it gives me that perfect balance.<br/>15. All the major clothing brands have their outlets in this mall.<br/>16. Every time I visit these outlets I can easily find some offers running which allow me to make good purchases within my purchasing power.<br/>17. I might not get the best of the lot but I always get decent clothes at reasonable prices.<br/>18. I have already gathered a nice collection of clothes, shoes and some accessories, all thanks to the shopping mall.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5477565220\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>19. There is one more reason why I like this mall and that is its food court.<br/>20. Every time I go there for shopping, I specially reserve extra half an hour for a visit to the food court.<br/>21. I simply love the place for the options it has which I don\u2019t normally find at local food joints.<br/>22. I can choose from all the popular cuisines including Indian, Continental, Chinese, Mexican, Mughlai, Italian and many more.<br/>23. I find this place really refreshing and whenever I am a bit stressed I visit there with my friends.</p></div><p>1. My city is known for two things \u2013 food and clothes.<br/>2. The variety in both the categories is just staggering.<br/>3. And the reasonable prices just add to the attraction for the buyers who comprise not only of local residents but also consumers from other states.<br/>4. I too often bought clothes from a shop near by my home.<br/>5. Earlier I did not have a liking for a particular shop but of late I have developed a predilection for a shopping place.<br/>6. The place is Alpha shopping mall.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>7. It opened only two months back and has already become a popular place among local residents to hang out.<br/>8. Irrespective of the day of the week the place is swarmed with people because it is a one stop shop for people.<br/>9. The biggest advantage of the shopping mall is its central location which makes it easily accessible to all the people of the city.<br/>10. But for me the main attraction is the options that it provides me.<br/>11. I am not a brand conscious person but I don\u2019t mind wearing branded clothes either.<br/>12. I am not willing to pay exorbitant price just to put a brand name on my clothes.<br/>13. For me there should be a balance between the appearance of a clothing and the price I pay for it.<br/>14. And that is why I love this place because it gives me that perfect balance.<br/>15. All the major clothing brands have their outlets in this mall.<br/>16. Every time I visit these outlets I can easily find some offers running which allow me to make good purchases within my purchasing power.<br/>17. I might not get the best of the lot but I always get decent clothes at reasonable prices.<br/>18. I have already gathered a nice collection of clothes, shoes and some accessories, all thanks to the shopping mall.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5477565220\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>19. There is one more reason why I like this mall and that is its food court.<br/>20. Every time I go there for shopping, I specially reserve extra half an hour for a visit to the food court.<br/>21. I simply love the place for the options it has which I don\u2019t normally find at local food joints.<br/>22. I can choose from all the popular cuisines including Indian, Continental, Chinese, Mexican, Mughlai, Italian and many more.<br/>23. I find this place really refreshing and whenever I am a bit stressed I visit there with my friends.</p>",
