  "supporting_text": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p>1. A student\u2019s success is predicated on several important factors.<br/>2. One of those important factors is the place where someone studies and I am talking about after school study time.<br/>3. Ideally a student\u2019s study place should be serene and quiet so that the student can concentrate for long span of time without much distractions.<br/>4. Luckily I have found one such place and that is our city library.<br/>5. This place was recommended to me by my father.<br/>6. He already had membership of the library so I did not have to go through the trouble of securing membership for myself.<br/>7. The library has a comprehensive collection of books on all the major topics including science, maths, economics and literature.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5477565220\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. Some of the books are exclusive there such as books on local history.<br/>9. I read these books in my spare time and find these very fascinating.<br/>10. My father has bought the premium membership because of which I get extra privileges in the library.<br/>11. These include access to the computer section of the library where I search for information which I could not get in the books of the library.<br/>12. Also I can borrow two more books than someone who has purchased the regular membership.<br/>13. I have been going to this library for the last couple of months daily and study there for nearly three hours everyday.<br/>14. I have also made some friends of my age there and we have formed a sort of study group.<br/>15. We share everything with each other which we think would help in our studies.<br/>16. The library is close to my home hence commuting is not a big problem for me.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>17. One of my friends from the study group lives in my society only so we do a bike pool daily.<br/>18. We take our bikes on alternate days to the library.<br/>19. Ever since I have joined this library I have formed a brilliant study routine and it reflects in recent performance in school tests.</p></div><p>1. A student\u2019s success is predicated on several important factors.<br/>2. One of those important factors is the place where someone studies and I am talking about after school study time.<br/>3. Ideally a student\u2019s study place should be serene and quiet so that the student can concentrate for long span of time without much distractions.<br/>4. Luckily I have found one such place and that is our city library.<br/>5. This place was recommended to me by my father.<br/>6. He already had membership of the library so I did not have to go through the trouble of securing membership for myself.<br/>7. The library has a comprehensive collection of books on all the major topics including science, maths, economics and literature.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5477565220\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. Some of the books are exclusive there such as books on local history.<br/>9. I read these books in my spare time and find these very fascinating.<br/>10. My father has bought the premium membership because of which I get extra privileges in the library.<br/>11. These include access to the computer section of the library where I search for information which I could not get in the books of the library.<br/>12. Also I can borrow two more books than someone who has purchased the regular membership.<br/>13. I have been going to this library for the last couple of months daily and study there for nearly three hours everyday.<br/>14. I have also made some friends of my age there and we have formed a sort of study group.<br/>15. We share everything with each other which we think would help in our studies.<br/>16. The library is close to my home hence commuting is not a big problem for me.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>17. One of my friends from the study group lives in my society only so we do a bike pool daily.<br/>18. We take our bikes on alternate days to the library.<br/>19. Ever since I have joined this library I have formed a brilliant study routine and it reflects in recent performance in school tests.</p>",
