  "prompts": [],
  "supporting_text": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p><p>1. Every year I go to some holiday destination with my family in summer vacations.<br/>2. This is the time of the year I really look forward to because for few days I can completely forget my worries and enjoy to the fullest.<br/>3. These vacations are refreshing for all of us and help to bring the family closer.<br/>4. In the summer vacations of the last 5 years we have explored all the major hill stations in our part of the country.<br/>5. I have a predilection for hilly areas as being a resident of a metro city I seldom get to see such beautiful sites full of greenery and fresh air.<br/>6. Although there are couple of more hill stations which are on my bucket list, for the next year\u2019s vacations I have someplace else in my mind.<br/>7. Two months back my cousin\u2019s family went to Andaman Islands.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. I checked his photos on facebook and in those photos the place looked good.<br/>9. But when he came back and detailed me about the place, it really got my curiosity awaken.<br/>10. He told me that Andaman is like no other place he has seen in India.<br/>11. It is an epitome of nature\u2019s creativity, with hills on one side and vast expanse of sea beach on the other.<br/>12. There is so much greenery and open spaces that he could not believe such a place could exist in this modern urbanized world.<br/>13. The frenzy of urbanization has not yet touched this part of our nation and there are still tribes present there which are living in their orthodox way.<br/>14. He met a few guys from these tribes and was really fascinated with their way of living.<br/>15. He also learnt about a few of their traditions which we would find absurd but are an integral part of their existence.<br/>16. Their diet is also absolutely different from what we normally have in our daily lives.<br/>17. Their diet primarily consists of sea creatures and my cousin showed me pictures of their meals which had sea creatures which I cannot even imagine to ingest.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>18. He was really enthralled by this visit as he got to see a completely different facet of mankind and nature.<br/>19. I am absolutely intrigued by the anecdotes he had shared with me about this place and would love to experience it firsthand.<br/>20. On top of that I have never seen a beach before so this visit would also help me to cross an item from my list of places to visit.</p><p><a href=\"../cambridge-ielts-1-13-tests/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cambridge IELTS TESTS 1 TO 13</strong></a></p></div><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p><p>1. Every year I go to some holiday destination with my family in summer vacations.<br/>2. This is the time of the year I really look forward to because for few days I can completely forget my worries and enjoy to the fullest.<br/>3. These vacations are refreshing for all of us and help to bring the family closer.<br/>4. In the summer vacations of the last 5 years we have explored all the major hill stations in our part of the country.<br/>5. I have a predilection for hilly areas as being a resident of a metro city I seldom get to see such beautiful sites full of greenery and fresh air.<br/>6. Although there are couple of more hill stations which are on my bucket list, for the next year\u2019s vacations I have someplace else in my mind.<br/>7. Two months back my cousin\u2019s family went to Andaman Islands.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. I checked his photos on facebook and in those photos the place looked good.<br/>9. But when he came back and detailed me about the place, it really got my curiosity awaken.<br/>10. He told me that Andaman is like no other place he has seen in India.<br/>11. It is an epitome of nature\u2019s creativity, with hills on one side and vast expanse of sea beach on the other.<br/>12. There is so much greenery and open spaces that he could not believe such a place could exist in this modern urbanized world.<br/>13. The frenzy of urbanization has not yet touched this part of our nation and there are still tribes present there which are living in their orthodox way.<br/>14. He met a few guys from these tribes and was really fascinated with their way of living.<br/>15. He also learnt about a few of their traditions which we would find absurd but are an integral part of their existence.<br/>16. Their diet is also absolutely different from what we normally have in our daily lives.<br/>17. Their diet primarily consists of sea creatures and my cousin showed me pictures of their meals which had sea creatures which I cannot even imagine to ingest.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>18. He was really enthralled by this visit as he got to see a completely different facet of mankind and nature.<br/>19. I am absolutely intrigued by the anecdotes he had shared with me about this place and would love to experience it firsthand.<br/>20. On top of that I have never seen a beach before so this visit would also help me to cross an item from my list of places to visit.</p><p><a href=\"../cambridge-ielts-1-13-tests/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cambridge IELTS TESTS 1 TO 13</strong></a></p>",
