  "prompts": [],
  "supporting_text": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p><p>1. Today\u2019s modern life has become very hectic.<br/>2. But there are sporadic moments when we all get some time for ourselves and I think we should take out some time for ourselves.<br/>3. These are the times when one can do some introspection or do something he or she really loves to do.<br/>4. Everybody has his or her way to spend these pleasurable moments.<br/>5. I like to resort to reading whenever I get free time.<br/>6. For me reading is just not a pastime, it is a way of life.<br/>7. Reading not only relaxes me it also empowers me to grow intellectually.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. Reading on different topics allows me to build an all-round perspective.<br/>9. Although I like to read on all important topics for a holistic improvement, I particularly enjoy reading philosophy.<br/>10. I first read philosophy in my higher secondary school and since then I have developed a predilection for the subject.<br/>11. I am really intrigued by the teachings of ancient Greek philosophers, for example, Plato and Aristotle.<br/>12. There teachings are really thought provoking and guide us towards achieving the goal of a better society.<br/>13. Apart from philosophy I enjoy reading literature especially the plays written by Shakespeare.<br/>14. These plays take me to a different world, a world so full of creativity.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>15. I can proudly say that the things I have read so have had a great influence on me and have shaped my personality for the better.<br/>16. I would sincerely urge everybody to take up this habit because I am certain that it would only work for their benefit.</p><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p></div><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p><p>1. Today\u2019s modern life has become very hectic.<br/>2. But there are sporadic moments when we all get some time for ourselves and I think we should take out some time for ourselves.<br/>3. These are the times when one can do some introspection or do something he or she really loves to do.<br/>4. Everybody has his or her way to spend these pleasurable moments.<br/>5. I like to resort to reading whenever I get free time.<br/>6. For me reading is just not a pastime, it is a way of life.<br/>7. Reading not only relaxes me it also empowers me to grow intellectually.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. Reading on different topics allows me to build an all-round perspective.<br/>9. Although I like to read on all important topics for a holistic improvement, I particularly enjoy reading philosophy.<br/>10. I first read philosophy in my higher secondary school and since then I have developed a predilection for the subject.<br/>11. I am really intrigued by the teachings of ancient Greek philosophers, for example, Plato and Aristotle.<br/>12. There teachings are really thought provoking and guide us towards achieving the goal of a better society.<br/>13. Apart from philosophy I enjoy reading literature especially the plays written by Shakespeare.<br/>14. These plays take me to a different world, a world so full of creativity.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>15. I can proudly say that the things I have read so have had a great influence on me and have shaped my personality for the better.<br/>16. I would sincerely urge everybody to take up this habit because I am certain that it would only work for their benefit.</p><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p>",
