  "test_id": "advice",
  "title": "Talk about your favorite place for shopping \u2013 IELTS MASTER",
  "part": "Part 2",
  "topic": "Talk about a time when you gave advice to someone",
  "content_type": "sample_answer",
  "cue_card_instructions": null,
  "prompts": [],
  "supporting_text": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p><p>1. My city is known for two things \u2013 food and clothes.<br/>2. The variety in both the categories is just staggering.<br/>3. And the reasonable prices just add to the attraction for the buyers who comprise not only of local residents but also consumers from other states.<br/>4. I too often bought clothes from a shop near by my home.<br/>5. Earlier I did not have a liking for a particular shop but of late I have developed a predilection for a shopping place.<br/>6. The place is Alpha shopping mall.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>7. It opened only two months back and has already become a popular place among local residents to hang out.<br/>8. The biggest advantage of the shopping mall is its central location which makes it easily accessible to all the people of the city.<br/>9. But for me the main attraction is the options that it provides me.<br/>10. I am not a brand conscious person but I don\u2019t mind wearing branded clothes either.<br/>11. I am not willing to pay exorbitant price just to put a brand name on my clothes.<br/>12. For me there should be a balance between the appearance of a clothing and the price I pay for it.<br/>13. And that is why I love this place because it gives me that perfect balance.<br/>14. All the major clothing brands have their outlets in this mall.<br/>15. Every time I visit these outlets I can easily find some offers running which allow me to make good purchases within my purchasing power.<br/>16. I might not get the best of the lot but I always get decent clothes at reasonable prices.<br/>17. I have already gathered a nice collection of clothes, shoes and some accessories, all thanks to the shopping mall.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>18. There is one more reason why I like this mall and that is its food court.<br/>19. Every time I go there for shopping, I specially reserve extra half an hour for a visit to the food court.<br/>20. I simply love the place for the options it has which I don\u2019t normally find at local food joints.<br/>21. I can choose from all the popular cuisines including Indian, Continental, Chinese, Mexican, Mughlai, Italian and many more.<br/>22. I find this place really refreshing and whenever I am a bit stressed I visit there with my friends.</p><p><a href=\"../cambridge-ielts-1-13-tests/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cambridge IELTS TESTS 1 TO 13</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p></div><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p><p>1. My city is known for two things \u2013 food and clothes.<br/>2. The variety in both the categories is just staggering.<br/>3. And the reasonable prices just add to the attraction for the buyers who comprise not only of local residents but also consumers from other states.<br/>4. I too often bought clothes from a shop near by my home.<br/>5. Earlier I did not have a liking for a particular shop but of late I have developed a predilection for a shopping place.<br/>6. The place is Alpha shopping mall.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>7. It opened only two months back and has already become a popular place among local residents to hang out.<br/>8. The biggest advantage of the shopping mall is its central location which makes it easily accessible to all the people of the city.<br/>9. But for me the main attraction is the options that it provides me.<br/>10. I am not a brand conscious person but I don\u2019t mind wearing branded clothes either.<br/>11. I am not willing to pay exorbitant price just to put a brand name on my clothes.<br/>12. For me there should be a balance between the appearance of a clothing and the price I pay for it.<br/>13. And that is why I love this place because it gives me that perfect balance.<br/>14. All the major clothing brands have their outlets in this mall.<br/>15. Every time I visit these outlets I can easily find some offers running which allow me to make good purchases within my purchasing power.<br/>16. I might not get the best of the lot but I always get decent clothes at reasonable prices.<br/>17. I have already gathered a nice collection of clothes, shoes and some accessories, all thanks to the shopping mall.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>18. There is one more reason why I like this mall and that is its food court.<br/>19. Every time I go there for shopping, I specially reserve extra half an hour for a visit to the food court.<br/>20. I simply love the place for the options it has which I don\u2019t normally find at local food joints.<br/>21. I can choose from all the popular cuisines including Indian, Continental, Chinese, Mexican, Mughlai, Italian and many more.<br/>22. I find this place really refreshing and whenever I am a bit stressed I visit there with my friends.</p><p><a href=\"../cambridge-ielts-1-13-tests/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cambridge IELTS TESTS 1 TO 13</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p>",
