  "test_id": "advice",
  "title": "Describe a time you visited a place with friends \u2013 IELTS MASTER",
  "part": "Part 2",
  "topic": "Talk about a time when you gave advice to someone",
  "content_type": "sample_answer",
  "cue_card_instructions": null,
  "prompts": [],
  "supporting_text": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p>1. Friends are like extended family.<br/>2. Friends are paramount in our lives because with friends we can be anybody we want to be.<br/>3. They are true stress busters.<br/>4. With family members we might sometimes feel reluctant but with friends we are akin to an open book.<br/>5. I have been blessed with some wonderful friends and some of the most cherished memories of my childhood are from the time I spent with my friends.<br/>6. I often go out with my friends to places like amusement parks, movie theaters, shopping malls or restaurants.<br/>7. Last weekend as well I went to Alpha shopping mall with my friends which is also one of our favorite places to hang out.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5477565220\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. The mall opened only two months back and has already become a popular place among local residents to hang out.<br/>9. The biggest advantage of the shopping mall is its central location which makes it easily accessible to all the people of the city.<br/>10. But for me the main attraction is the options that it provides me.<br/>11. Although I am not a brand conscious person but I don\u2019t mind wearing branded clothes either.<br/>12. I read in the newspaper that there was an off season sale running on all major brands in the mall so I convinced my friends to go and check it out.<br/>13. All the major clothing brands have their outlets in this mall.<br/>14. Every outlet we visited we could easily find some offers running which allowed us to make good purchases within our purchasing power.<br/>15. We probably did not get the best of the lot because the sale was already into its third day but we got decent clothes at reasonable prices.<br/>16. I gathered a nice collection of clothes, shoes and some accessories, all thanks to the sale in the shopping mall.<br/>17. There is one more reason why we like this mall and that is its food court.<br/>18. Every time we go there for shopping, we specially reserve extra half an hour for a visit to the food court.<br/>19. We simply love the place for the options it has which we don\u2019t normally find at local food joints.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>20. We can choose from all the popular cuisines including Indian, Continental, Chinese, Mexican, Mughlai, Italian and many more.<br/>21. This time we thought of trying Thai cuisine because none of us had either tasted it before.<br/>22. So we ordered a decent looking Thai dish from the menu.<br/>23. We did not know what to expect but fortunately it turned out to a delectable meal, and we savored every bite of it.<br/>24. I find this place really refreshing and whenever I am a bit stressed I visit there with my friends.</p></div><p>1. Friends are like extended family.<br/>2. Friends are paramount in our lives because with friends we can be anybody we want to be.<br/>3. They are true stress busters.<br/>4. With family members we might sometimes feel reluctant but with friends we are akin to an open book.<br/>5. I have been blessed with some wonderful friends and some of the most cherished memories of my childhood are from the time I spent with my friends.<br/>6. I often go out with my friends to places like amusement parks, movie theaters, shopping malls or restaurants.<br/>7. Last weekend as well I went to Alpha shopping mall with my friends which is also one of our favorite places to hang out.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5477565220\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. The mall opened only two months back and has already become a popular place among local residents to hang out.<br/>9. The biggest advantage of the shopping mall is its central location which makes it easily accessible to all the people of the city.<br/>10. But for me the main attraction is the options that it provides me.<br/>11. Although I am not a brand conscious person but I don\u2019t mind wearing branded clothes either.<br/>12. I read in the newspaper that there was an off season sale running on all major brands in the mall so I convinced my friends to go and check it out.<br/>13. All the major clothing brands have their outlets in this mall.<br/>14. Every outlet we visited we could easily find some offers running which allowed us to make good purchases within our purchasing power.<br/>15. We probably did not get the best of the lot because the sale was already into its third day but we got decent clothes at reasonable prices.<br/>16. I gathered a nice collection of clothes, shoes and some accessories, all thanks to the sale in the shopping mall.<br/>17. There is one more reason why we like this mall and that is its food court.<br/>18. Every time we go there for shopping, we specially reserve extra half an hour for a visit to the food court.<br/>19. We simply love the place for the options it has which we don\u2019t normally find at local food joints.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7372142965\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>20. We can choose from all the popular cuisines including Indian, Continental, Chinese, Mexican, Mughlai, Italian and many more.<br/>21. This time we thought of trying Thai cuisine because none of us had either tasted it before.<br/>22. So we ordered a decent looking Thai dish from the menu.<br/>23. We did not know what to expect but fortunately it turned out to a delectable meal, and we savored every bite of it.<br/>24. I find this place really refreshing and whenever I am a bit stressed I visit there with my friends.</p>",
