  "supporting_text": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p><p>1. I have always dreamt of visiting a beach.<br/>2. The best beach destination in India is Goa.<br/>3. I have heard a lot about Goa especially about its new year celebrations.<br/>4. People from all over the world come to Goa in December to celebrate new year.<br/>5. During that season it is a coveted place among tourists.<br/>6. Last year in December I had vacations of nearly 15 days.<br/>7. So I shared my wish with my friends to visit Goa at least once in my lifetime and proposed that we should plan a trip to Goa.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. Two days later one of my friends formed a Whatsapp group by the title \u2018Goa Calling\u2019 and included me and three more friends in that group.<br/>9. Initially I ignored it as a prank but when I met them later in the evening they seemed serious about the visit.<br/>10. So we decided to talk to our parents about our trip.<br/>11. Luckily our parents agreed though it took some convincing.<br/>12. So everything was agreed upon and planned out.<br/>13. We were supposed to book our flight tickets next day.<br/>14. But as fate would have it, my dream of going to Goa that year did not come to fruition as a news came which forced me to change my plan.<br/>15. The night before my uncle called and he told that my cousin who is in Australia was coming on short trip to India.<br/>16. He had gone to Australia to study four years ago and since then had not come to India.<br/>17. This was his first visit to India since then and he was coming just for a week.<br/>18. Unfortunately he was going back to Australia two days before my vacations were getting over.<br/>19. I and my cousin have always been very close to each other.<br/>20. He is three years older to me but we have always been like friends.<br/>21. I had shared some great moments with him in my childhood.<br/>22. And I wanted to relive some of those cherished memories again so I dropped my plan to Goa that year and stayed back to spent time with my cousin.<br/>23. I am sure I would have had a blast in Goa but I have no regrets as I spent great time with my cousin.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>24. And I was well compensated for my sacrifice as he had brought me Apple smartwatch.<br/>25. Goa is still on my bucket list and I am sure I will get an opportunity to fulfill my dream of celebrating new year in Goa.</p><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p></div><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p><p>1. I have always dreamt of visiting a beach.<br/>2. The best beach destination in India is Goa.<br/>3. I have heard a lot about Goa especially about its new year celebrations.<br/>4. People from all over the world come to Goa in December to celebrate new year.<br/>5. During that season it is a coveted place among tourists.<br/>6. Last year in December I had vacations of nearly 15 days.<br/>7. So I shared my wish with my friends to visit Goa at least once in my lifetime and proposed that we should plan a trip to Goa.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>8. Two days later one of my friends formed a Whatsapp group by the title \u2018Goa Calling\u2019 and included me and three more friends in that group.<br/>9. Initially I ignored it as a prank but when I met them later in the evening they seemed serious about the visit.<br/>10. So we decided to talk to our parents about our trip.<br/>11. Luckily our parents agreed though it took some convincing.<br/>12. So everything was agreed upon and planned out.<br/>13. We were supposed to book our flight tickets next day.<br/>14. But as fate would have it, my dream of going to Goa that year did not come to fruition as a news came which forced me to change my plan.<br/>15. The night before my uncle called and he told that my cousin who is in Australia was coming on short trip to India.<br/>16. He had gone to Australia to study four years ago and since then had not come to India.<br/>17. This was his first visit to India since then and he was coming just for a week.<br/>18. Unfortunately he was going back to Australia two days before my vacations were getting over.<br/>19. I and my cousin have always been very close to each other.<br/>20. He is three years older to me but we have always been like friends.<br/>21. I had shared some great moments with him in my childhood.<br/>22. And I wanted to relive some of those cherished memories again so I dropped my plan to Goa that year and stayed back to spent time with my cousin.<br/>23. I am sure I would have had a blast in Goa but I have no regrets as I spent great time with my cousin.</p><p><br/><ins data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5700321813195736\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"5680584161\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></ins></p><p>24. And I was well compensated for my sacrifice as he had brought me Apple smartwatch.<br/>25. Goa is still on my bucket list and I am sure I will get an opportunity to fulfill my dream of celebrating new year in Goa.</p><p><a href=\"../ielts-speaking-latest-makkar-cue-cards/index.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Latest Makkar cue cards with new solutions</strong></a></p>",
